    bullets: ["Comprehensive health history intake and detailed symptom evaluation with advanced diagnostic testing","Personalized treatment protocols addressing unique imbalances through targeted interventions","Integration of nutritional therapy, supplementation, lifestyle modifications, and stress management","Regular monitoring and follow-up to track progress and adjust treatments for sustained improvement","Therapeutic partnership approach empowering you to take an active role in your health journey","Evidence-based methodology combining modern medical science with comprehensive systems-based care"],
