    badge: "Services",
    title: "Hormone Replacement Therapy",
    metaTitle: "Hormone Replacement Therapy in Edmond, OK | Encompass Wellness",
    headline: "Hormone Replacement Therapy in Edmond",
    description: "Expert hormone replacement therapy in Edmond. Restore balance, energy, and vitality with personalized bioidentical hormone treatments at Encompass Wellness and Aesthetics.",
    heroSubhead: "Restore hormonal balance and reclaim your vitality with personalized bioidentical hormone replacement therapy tailored to your unique needs. At Encompass Wellness and Aesthetics, we combine advanced diagnostic testing with evidence-based treatments to help you feel like yourself again.",
    introHeading: "What is Hormone Replacement Therapy?",
    intro: ["Hormone Replacement Therapy (HRT) is a medical treatment designed to supplement or replace hormones that have declined or become imbalanced in the body. As we age, our bodies naturally produce less of the essential hormones that regulate energy, metabolism, mood, cognitive function, sexual health, and overall vitality. For women, this decline often occurs during perimenopause and menopause, while men typically experience a gradual decrease in testosterone beginning in their thirties and forties. These hormonal shifts can significantly impact quality of life, leading to symptoms that range from mildly inconvenient to truly debilitating.","At Encompass Wellness and Aesthetics, we specialize in bioidentical hormone replacement therapy (BHRT), which uses hormones that are molecularly identical to those your body naturally produces. Unlike synthetic hormones, bioidentical hormones are derived from plant sources and are customized to match your individual hormonal profile. This personalized approach allows for more precise dosing and often results in fewer side effects and better outcomes. Our comprehensive hormone optimization programs address deficiencies in estrogen, progesterone, testosterone, thyroid hormones, DHEA, and other key hormones that influence your health and well-being.","The decision to pursue hormone replacement therapy should be based on thorough testing, careful evaluation of symptoms, and a detailed discussion of your health goals and concerns. Our medical team uses advanced diagnostic tools including comprehensive blood panels, saliva testing, and symptom assessments to create a complete picture of your hormonal health. We then develop a customized treatment plan that may include bioidentical hormones delivered through creams, patches, pellets, or oral medications, along with lifestyle modifications and nutritional support to optimize your results."],
    signsHeading: "Common Signs You May Benefit from Hormone Replacement Therapy",
