    gallery: [{"src":"/images/scraped/1894786.jpeg","alt":"Votiva vaginal rejuvenation — 2"},{"src":"/images/scraped/formav.jpg","alt":"Votiva vaginal rejuvenation — 3","fit":"contain"},{"src":"/images/scraped/bluemarble.jpg","alt":"Votiva treatment","fit":"contain"}],
    badge: "Services",
    title: "Vaginal Rejuvenation",
    metaTitle: "Vaginal Rejuvenation in Edmond, OK | Votiva & FormaV",
    headline: "Vaginal Rejuvenation",
    description: "Non-surgical, pain-free vaginal rejuvenation in Edmond, OK with Votiva by FormaV — treating dryness, elasticity, stress urinary incontinence, tightening and decreased sensation.",
    heroSubhead: "We offer advanced non-invasive technology that addresses both internal and external feminine health concerns. Your sexual health can affect your confidence and overall well-being — which is why it deserves the same attention as your physical health.",
    introHeading: "Non-Invasive Technology",
    intro: ["We offer the most advanced non-invasive technology that addresses both internal and external feminine health concerns. Your sexual health can affect your confidence and overall well-being. That's why it's just as important to focus on your sexual health as your physical health.","Votiva by FormaV is a non-surgical, pain-free vaginal rejuvenation treatment. It gently heats tissue from the inside or outside of the vaginal canal, depending on the area being treated. You will notice a warm sensation, but you will feel safe and comfortable for the entire treatment.","Votiva is right for women at any stage of life. After childbirth or menopause, or as a natural result of aging, many women experience changes that can affect their sexual confidence and relationships. If you're looking for non-hormonal solutions to any of these symptoms, you're likely a good candidate."],
    signsHeading: "Symptoms Votiva Can Treat",
    signsList: ["Vaginal dryness and loss of elasticity","Stress urinary incontinence","Laxity of labial and vaginal tissue","Decreased sensation","Sexual dysfunction","Changes following childbirth or menopause"],
    bullets: ["Non-surgical and 100% pain-free","Treats both internal and external feminine health concerns","A non-hormonal option for women who cannot or prefer not to use hormones","Appropriate for women at any stage of life","Noticeable improvement after the first session","Delivered discreetly by staff experienced in feminine health"],
    benefits: [{"title":"Pain-Free Treatment","body":"Votiva is non-surgical and 100% painless. You will notice a warm sensation and remain comfortable throughout."},{"title":"Non-Hormonal","body":"A good option for women seeking solutions that do not involve hormone therapy."},{"title":"Addresses Incontinence","body":"Stress urinary incontinence is one of the symptoms Votiva is designed to treat."},{"title":"Restores Elasticity","body":"Gentle heating supports tissue tone, elasticity and comfort, internally and externally."},{"title":"Results After One Session","body":"Multiple treatments are recommended for optimal results, but improvement is noticeable after the first."},{"title":"Handled With Professionalism","body":"Our staff is prepared to help you navigate this decision with the utmost professionalism and discretion."}],
    faqs: [{"q":"Is Votiva right for me?","a":"Votiva is right for women at any stage of life. After childbirth or menopause, or as a natural result of aging, many women experience changes that can affect their sexual confidence and relationships. If you're looking for non-hormonal solutions to dryness, elasticity, incontinence or sensation, you're likely a good candidate."},{"q":"What happens during treatment?","a":"Votiva is non-surgical and 100% painless. During your treatment, Votiva will gently heat your muscles from the inside or outside the vaginal canal, depending on which area you want to treat. You will notice a warm sensation, but you will feel safe and comfortable for the entire treatment."},{"q":"When will I see results?","a":"Multiple treatments are recommended to achieve optimal results, but you will notice improvement after the first session."},{"q":"Is there downtime?","a":"Votiva is a non-invasive treatment, and patients are typically able to return to their normal routine. Your provider will go over anything specific to your treatment plan at your consultation."}],
    relatedLinks: [{"href":"/services/womens-sexual-health","label":"Women's Sexual Health","eyebrow":"Related","body":"The Female Shot, EmpowerRF, VTone and Morpheus8V for libido, comfort and incontinence."},{"href":"/services/hormone-replacement-therapy","label":"Hormone Replacement Therapy","eyebrow":"Related","body":"Addressing the hormonal changes behind many feminine health symptoms."},{"href":"/conditions/menopausal-symptoms","label":"Menopausal Symptoms","eyebrow":"Related","body":"Understanding the changes of menopause and the options available."}],
