    badge: "Services",
    title: "Facials & Peels",
    metaTitle: "Facials & Chemical Peels in Edmond, OK",
    headline: "Facials & Peels",
    description: "Facials and chemical peels in Edmond, OK — anti-aging and acneic facials, dermaplaning and chemical peels to exfoliate, hydrate, clear pores and restore a glowing complexion.",
    heroSubhead: "Dull and lifeless skin doesn't have to be your norm. Encompass offers facials and peels that exfoliate dead cells, hydrate, clear out pores and nourish — restoring the youthful appearance of your skin.",
    introHeading: "A Glowing Complexion",
    intro: ["Dull and lifeless skin doesn't have to be your norm. Encompass offers facials and peels to give your skin a luminous glow, restore the youthful appearance of your skin and reverse the signs of aging.","These skin care treatments promote a healthy complexion by exfoliating dead cells, hydrating, clearing out pores, and nourishing the skin. The right treatment depends on your skin type and texture — our experienced team can help you determine which is right for you.","To book any of these services, please call us at 405-254-3000."],
    signsHeading: "Benefits of Facials & Peels",
    signsList: ["Refresh dull, lifeless skin","Remove acne-causing bacteria","Improve skin texture","Stimulate cell regeneration","Correct hyperpigmentation","Reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles","Lessen sun damage, freckles and sun spots","Diminish the appearance of acne scars"],
    bullets: ["Anti-Aging facial — $125–$175","Acneic facial — $125–$175","Dermaplane — $50","Dermaplaning Spa Facial — $125","Chemical Peels — $125–$250","Our experienced team will help you choose the right treatment for your skin type and texture"],
    premiumHeading: "Facial Services Menu",
    premiumIntro: "Pricing as listed at our Edmond clinic. Call 405-254-3000 to book.",
    premiumOptions: [{"title":"Anti-Aging Facial — $125–$175","body":"Targets fine lines, texture and loss of radiance, stimulating cell regeneration for a firmer, brighter complexion."},{"title":"Acneic Facial — $125–$175","body":"Deep cleansing focused on removing acne-causing bacteria, clearing congested pores and calming problem skin."},{"title":"Dermaplane — $50","body":"Physical exfoliation that removes dead surface cells and vellus hair, leaving skin immediately smoother and makeup-ready."},{"title":"Dermaplaning Spa Facial — $125","body":"Dermaplaning combined with a full spa facial for exfoliation, hydration and nourishment in one appointment."},{"title":"Chemical Peels — $125–$250","body":"Resurfacing peels to correct hyperpigmentation, lessen sun damage, freckles and sun spots, and diminish the appearance of acne scars."}],
    benefits: [{"title":"Exfoliates Dead Cells","body":"Removing the dull surface layer is what produces the immediate change in radiance and texture."},{"title":"Clears Congested Pores","body":"Deep cleansing removes acne-causing bacteria and debris that keep problem skin cycling."},{"title":"Corrects Pigmentation","body":"Peels lessen sun damage, freckles and sun spots and help correct hyperpigmentation over a series."},{"title":"Stimulates Regeneration","body":"Treatment encourages cell turnover, improving texture and softening fine lines and wrinkles."},{"title":"Hydrates and Nourishes","body":"Facials finish by replenishing moisture and nutrients, which is what makes the result last beyond the appointment."},{"title":"Matched to Your Skin","body":"Our experienced team determines which treatments suit your skin type and texture rather than applying one protocol to everyone."}],
    faqs: [{"q":"How do I know which facial or peel is right for me?","a":"The experienced team at Encompass can help you determine which treatments are right for your skin type and texture. Call us at 405-254-3000 to discuss your skin and book."},{"q":"What does a facial or peel cost?","a":"Anti-aging and acneic facials are $125–$175, dermaplaning is $50, a dermaplaning spa facial is $125, and chemical peels run $125–$250 depending on the peel."},{"q":"What is dermaplaning?","a":"Dermaplaning is a physical exfoliation treatment that removes dead surface cells and fine vellus hair, leaving the skin immediately smoother. It can be booked alone or as part of a full spa facial."},{"q":"Can facials help with acne scarring?","a":"Chemical peels can diminish the appearance of acne scars and improve overall texture. For deeper scarring we may recommend combining peels with SkinPen microneedling."}],
    relatedLinks: [{"href":"/services/hydrafacial","label":"HydraFacial","eyebrow":"Related","body":"Cleanse, extract and hydrate in three steps and thirty minutes."},{"href":"/services/microneedling-skinpen","label":"SkinPen Microneedling","eyebrow":"Related","body":"Collagen stimulation for acne scars and neck wrinkles."},{"href":"/services/prp-facials","label":"PRP Facials","eyebrow":"Related","body":"Use your own platelet-rich plasma to boost collagen production."}],
    ctaHeading: "Treat Your Skin Today",
    ctaBody: "Call 405-254-3000 or contact us to book your facial or peel.",
